OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPlenty of
OL,6,Fevening sunshine to come but a very
OL,7,Fisolated shower cannot be ruled out. A
OL,8,Fdry and mostly clear night then
OL,9,Ffollows with light winds. Feeling
OL,10,Frather cool compared to recent nights.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA dry and bright start to
OL,13,FFriday with variable cloud and sunny
OL,14,Fspells. Cloud builds through the
OL,15,Fmorning, leading to a few isolated
OL,16,Fshowers, locally perhaps heavy by the
OL,17,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
